{"sba-hinata-24305":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ \n高瀬愛奈です🐰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0QKEDNRXXCCDDYA3YK9F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0RM33Y5ZGQGK88FK7DG6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0SQKZNC660DEMSZ4K5JA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0TQ7T41VZC3T6PX59X42","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんわん🐶高瀬しなもん愛奈です。\n手がなんかわんわんじゃなくて頑張るぞポーズみたいになってる٩( 'ω' )و💪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいただいたお花の写真を載せようと思います！！✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0VN5AJ2VDWK6R1AEB4DK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも歩いてるの衣装のカラーのバルーンがすっごくかわいい!!真っ白なお花もきれいで嬉しいです🌸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0WNDK096R8GTB7KSDVHA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nサイリウムカラーのピンクと白のかわいいお花!!リボンもすっごくかわいいです！やっぱりピンクと白大好き〜💗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0XN55ZJY3DPEEZVCX92P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真ん中の大きなハートがすっごくきれいでかわいい💕まわりのサイリウムカラーのバルーンも嬉しいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0YNZ4W6GSB3HP81NGP1Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなピンクと可愛い黄色のお花〜！！小さな黄色いお花がすっごく可愛い！！🌼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N0ZP8F7CCWXDFXAQ9SJB7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の大好きなものが詰まっているお花です！！ピンクたくさんでハートやマイメロちゃんがいて可愛すぎます🐰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1N10MFZHA79A6KEXJNK397","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横断幕も作ってくださって本当に嬉しかったです!!\nこんなにたくさんのお花ありがとうございました💕\nいつも素敵な可愛いお花を考えてくださって、プレゼントしてくださって、本当に幸せです😊\n自分のレーンに入ってお花がたくさんあると、テンションも上がるしウキウキ気分になります！\n最初の頃は考えられないくらい、毎回お花がたくさんあって嬉しいです！\n写真をブログに載せて感謝の気持ちを伝えるくらいしかできないけど、本当に本当に嬉しいです！！✨\nいつもありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は写真たくさんブログでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださってありがとうございました💗\n高瀬愛奈／(o・ω・o)＼"}],"source":"archive"}}